{
  "name": "the key-press opt-out comes only after the call has reached a person",
  "description": "The connect to an app user at index 1 already discharges P3 for the identification at index 0; the later prompt and input are extra. Speech after the live leg is not before any identification, so P2 and P5 stay true.",
